EF AI Workspace (#175): the employee's chat journey on a laptop and a phone — new chat, talk to «بصير», manage chats.
Owner request 2026-10-24: quality and UX tests of that journey in a laptop and a phone browser; fix every problem.

- Chat list order (utils/convos.ts, upstream defect): a new chat's own state carries `createdAt: ''` and
  `updatedAt: ''`, and the sidebar wrote them over the row. The list reads an empty date as "now" on every render, so
  every chat started in the session stayed above the chat the employee had just continued, until a reload. An empty
  date no longer replaces a known one (convos.spec.ts).
- Phone composer (Chat/Input/TokenUsage): after the first reply the context gauge joined the row and pushed the send
  button onto a second row (the composer grew by 52 px, the send and stop button jumped to the other side, and an
  opened chat's last reply sat behind the composer). On phones the gauge appears once half the context is used. Its
  track is lighter, so a nearly empty gauge no longer reads as a loading spinner.
- Phone keyboard (store/settings.ts): on a touch screen Return starts a new line and the send button sends, as in
  ChatGPT and Claude (phone keyboards have no Shift+Enter, so a request could not have two lines). Settings → Chat
  keeps the switch per device.
- Share dialog (ConvoOptions/ShareButton.tsx): while the link loaded, the default focus went to the title's info
  button and its card covered the dialog; the dialog itself takes the focus.
- Accessible names = visible names (WCAG 2.5.3): the side-menu rail (ExpandedPanel.tsx; «الدردشات» was announced
  «سجل الدردشة», «المحفوظة» «الإشارات المرجعية», «المعلمات» «معلمات النموذج») and the phone drawer's panel button
  (mobile/Switcher.tsx; «سجل الدردشة» was announced «لوحة التحكم», now «سجل الدردشة، اختر لوحة»; the new key's English
  source in locales/en). ExpandedPanel.spec.tsx finds the rail buttons by their visible names.

